# This branch is the published GitHub Pages site and nothing else.
#
# It should only ever contain:
#   .nojekyll      - stops Pages running the files through Jekyll
#   index.html     - the demo, built from web/dist-demo/index.html
#   b/index.html   - the same file again, so links shared while the intake
#                    A/B test was running (including b/#/tradies) keep working
#
# There is one demo now: problem-first won the A/B test (D11) and the
# sign-up-first arm was removed from the codebase. Publish the same built
# file to both paths.
#
# The demo is a single self-contained HTML file, so there are no asset
# directories to publish alongside it. Source, builds and dependencies
# belong on main -- never here.
#
# These entries exist because a past publish swept ~12,000 dependency
# files onto this branch by accident.

node_modules/
web/
dist/
dist-demo/
dist-demo-b/
src/

*.log
.DS_Store
